## 💰 Trading Engine (LIVE)

### Solana Trading
- **Status:** ✅ LIVE
- **Aggregator:** Jupiter
- **Features:** MEV protection, slippage tolerance, auto-execution
- **Command:** `/swap_sol <from> <to> <amount>`

### Base L2 Trading
- **Status:** ✅ LIVE
- **DEX:** Uniswap V3
- **Features:** Gas optimization, price impact calculation
- **Command:** `/swap_base <from> <to> <amount>`

### Polymarket Trading
- **Status:** ✅ Paper + Live
- **Features:** CLOB integration, paper mode for testing
- **Commands:**
  - `/polymarket_enable_live` - Enable live trading
  - `/polymarket_paper_mode` - Safe paper mode

### Best Crypto Swap
- **Status:** ✅ LIVE
- **Aggregators:** 1inch, Paraswap, 0x, Kyber, Odos, OKX
- **Networks:** Ethereum, Base, Arbitrum, Polygon, Plasma
- **Commands:**
  - `/best_swap_quote <network> <from> <to> <amount>`
  - `/best_swap_execute <network> <from> <to> <amount>`
  - `/best_swap_compare <network> <from> <to> <amount>`

### Performance Analytics
- **PnL Calculation:** Per-trade and aggregate
- **Win Rate:** Success/failure tracking
- **Max Drawdown:** Risk assessment
- **Edge Calculation:** Expected value per trade
- **Strategy Fitness:** Which approaches work best
- **Command:** `/trading_status`

